OL,3,GNEWSA'Knock-on effects' if hospital
OL,4,Asuspends maternity services, trust
OL,5,Achief says
OL,6,
OL,7,FIf plans for a temporary suspension of
OL,8,Fmaternity services go ahead at Daisy
OL,9,FHill hospital, there could be "knock-on
OL,10,Feffects" at Craigavon Area Hosptial,
OL,11,Fthe Southern Trust's interim chief
OL,12,Fexecutive has said.
OL,14,FSteve Spoerry said they "don't want
OL,15,Fthis to happen" but it "looks more
OL,16,Flikely than not" that it will.
OL,18,FOn Monday the trust, which oversees the
OL,19,Fhospital, said it has not been able to
OL,20,Frecruit consultant obstetricians to
OL,21,Ffill vacancies at the hospital.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,414,410,260,120,0,100
