OL,3,GNEWSA'Knock-on effects' if hospital
OL,4,Asuspends maternity services, trust
OL,5,Achief says
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt is preparing to temporarily move
OL,8,Finpatient maternity services to
OL,9,FCraigavon and, if plans go ahead, no
OL,10,Fbabies will be delivered at Daisy Hill
OL,11,FHospital in Newry.
